2026-07-27T08:23:55.4834831Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4903292Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4903921Z i /tmp/Rtmp0ZgevB/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4904343Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4904877Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4905711Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4906417Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4907472Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:23:55.4908257Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:23:55.5173451Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:55.5282333Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:55.5762578Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:55.5947871Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
